 How bp helps keep Americans moving 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Every day, millions of customers count on bp's fuel to keep going. Behind every fill-up is a connected downstream system: two major refineries, a trading operation, and more than 8,500 gas stations and travel centers across 46 states.


